title: ClassDoor
---
<<if isPeriod("Morning")>>
    Do you want to go to Class and start your day?

    -> Yes
        <<jump EnterClass>>
    -> No
        <<jump StayHere>>
<<else>>
    You can't enter the classroom right now.
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
===

title: ChapelDoor
---
<<if isPeriod("Chapel")>>
    Do you want to go to Chapel and get a credit? 

    -> Yes
        <<jump EnterChapel>>
    -> No
        <<jump StayHere>>
<<else>>
    You can't enter the Chapel right now.
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
===


title: KetlerDoor
---
<<if isPeriod("Chapel")>>
    You can't return to the Hallway right now.
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

Do you want to go to the Buffalo Hall?

-> Yes
    <<jump EnterHall>>
-> No
    <<jump StayHere>>
